Subject: [PATCH] fix(update): keep main.ts within its size cap for backup
 progress [daveey]

The backup-tick log filter moves to updater/checkout.ts (updateProgressLogLine)
and readDesktopUpdateConfig moves from main.ts to updater/checkout-source.ts
(configPath and default branch as parameters), so main.ts shrinks instead of
growing past its health cap. Both are unit-tested.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
